{"id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-cardinality.md","title":"Cardinality","display":"df-cardinality — Cardinality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-cardinality","aliases":["88-df-cardinality"],"display":"df-cardinality — Cardinality","depends_on":["[[88-df-ordinal]]","[[88-df-bijective]]","[[88-df-injective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-cardinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-cardinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinality — Cardinality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44f871cfd68c1a70\" href=\"?note=44f871cfd68c1a70\" title=\"88-df-ordinal\">88-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fd20a9a341b65d3\" href=\"?note=1fd20a9a341b65d3\" title=\"88-df-bijective\">88-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"186aad749d027077\" href=\"?note=186aad749d027077\" title=\"88-df-injective\">88-df-injective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li>Ambient metatheory: ZFC (in particular every set is well-orderable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44f871cfd68c1a70\" href=\"?note=44f871cfd68c1a70\" title=\"88-df-ordinal\">88-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1fd20a9a341b65d3\" href=\"?note=1fd20a9a341b65d3\" title=\"88-df-bijective\">88-df-bijective</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"186aad749d027077\" href=\"?note=186aad749d027077\" title=\"88-df-injective\">88-df-injective</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> (cardinality notation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\approx B\">\\(A \\approx B\\)</span> (equinumerosity relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}(\\alpha)\\)</span> (initial-ordinal predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\nA\\approx B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\nA\\approx B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\neg(\\alpha\\approx\\beta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\neg(\\alpha\\approx\\beta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\n|A|=\\alpha\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\alpha)\\land A\\approx\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\n|A|=\\alpha\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\alpha)\\land A\\approx\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash |A|=|B|\\leftrightarrow A\\approx B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash |A|=|B|\\leftrightarrow A\\approx B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\n|A|\\leq|B|\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinality} \\vdash\n|A|\\leq|B|\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> : 集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的基数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\approx B\">\\(A \\approx B\\)</span> : 集合等势</li>\n<li>ZFC 保证每个集合恰与一个初始序数等势；因此第三个等价式唯一确定\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span>，不再依赖无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\in}\">\\(\\min_{\\in}\\)</span> 运算符。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"44f871cfd68c1a70","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-bijective","sta